nding of Orange Business strategy and solutions/portfolio \n understanding of International customers and its business buildup \n understanding market & sales intelligence and facilitate embedding this in the Marketing plan \n ability to animate the main users of the market data intelligence \n\nKey Skills: \n\nMandatory skills: \n\n Proven proficiency in Data Analytics (using preferably Tableau but other BI tools are acceptable - Tableau, QlikSense/QlikView, Looker, etc.) \n Proficiency in data modelling & automation (ETL, ELT, creating & maintaining data pipelines) \n Data Science/ML Engineering background - understanding statistical models & implementing suitable ML models for different UCs (supervised vs unsupervised modelling), programming language - preferably Python (pandas, numpy, scikit-learn, etc.) \n Proficiency in Business analytics -> full E2E delivery \n Solid stakeholder & project management skills \n\nOptional Skills\n\n Agile frameworks (SAFe, LEAN, etc.) \n Knowledge of Scrum/Kanban \n Knowledge of CI/CD best practices (GIT - GitLab, Sourcetree, etc.) \n CRM systems (SFDC is preferred but understanding CRM data governance is a plus) \n\nBase salary from 2 410 \u20ac brutto per month, actual salary is likely to be higher based on skills, knowledge and experience.\n\nYou bring rigor, passion for challenges, and determination. You seek the opportunity to expand your expertise, achieve your goals, and thrive.", "lastUpdate": "2026-10-07 15:15 IST", "referralName": "", "referralContact": "", "referralStatus": "", "resumeFileId": "1uBi5ifbUn7snBzU83GiMgD4kavwnrqv-", "resumeUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clFileId": "", "clUrl": "", "sections": {"summary": "<p>Senior Data &amp; Business Analyst combining extensive enterprise data analytics and operations intelligence experience with a strong foundation in commercial strategy and stakeholder consulting. Proven track record of utilizing <strong>SQL, Python, and Tableau</strong