NDED EXPERIENCE & JD ALIGNMENT DIRECTIVE: Always open the Summary with the grounded title \"Senior Data & Business Analyst\" (never copy the target job title verbatim). Anchor 80% of the Summary in a qualitative synthesis of Sumanto's real experience across enterprise data analytics, BI dashboard automation, operational process governance, and commercial stakeholder strategy (strictly WITHOUT numerical statistics or percentages), and weave in 20% (up to 2 overlapping competency phrases) aligned with the target Job Description.", "createdAt": "2026-10-23T18:33:11.093615"}, {"id": 706, "category": "LinkedIn Post", "text": "LINKEDIN COMMENTS & OUTREACH \u2014 SHORT, IMPACTFUL & HUMAN-LIKE DIRECTIVE: NEVER write multi-sentence paragraphs, corporate buzzwords, or self-promotional tech-stack lists (such as \"I work in SQL, Python, and Tableau\") in LinkedIn comments or connection notes. ALWAYS keep post comments to 1 crisp, natural human sentence (6\u201313 words max) reacting directly to the core point, and keep connection notes to 1 warm sentence (8\u201315 words max).", "createdAt": "2026-10-23T14:30:36.759351"}, {"id": 704, "category": "summary", "text": "SUMMARY \u2014 80/20 GROUNDED EXPERIENCE & JD ALIGNMENT DIRECTIVE: Always open the Summary with the grounded title \"Senior Data & Business Analyst\" (never copy the target job title verbatim). Anchor 80% of the Summary in a qualitative synthesis of Sumanto's real experience across enterprise data analytics, BI dashboard automation, operational process governance, and commercial stakeholder strategy (strictly WITHOUT numerical statistics or percentages), and weave in 20% (up to 2 overlapping competency phrases) aligned with the target Job Description.", "createdAt": "2026-10-23T10:33:47.332723"}, {"id": 703, "category": "summary", "text": "SUMMARY \u2014 80/20 GROUNDED EXPERIENCE & JD ALIGNMENT DIRECTIVE: Always open the Summary with the grounded title \"Senior Data & Business Analyst\" (never copy the target job tit